//Arms: puffed sleeves gathered at the elbow, laced forearm sleeves, frill cuffs, hands
# Sleeve sections at each height q (measured on the sheet's front, side and back views): centre
# slx, sly and half-widths sla across, slb front to back; slg the gathers at the elbow band and the puff's folds.
slx(q)=0.95657+(-1.68584)*(q-8)+(-1.53994)*(q-8)^2+(-0.53119)*(q-8)^3+1.15476*max(0,q-9.25)^3+(-1.96264)*max(0,q-8.92)^3+(-1.15954)*max(0,q-8.68)^3+14.17444*max(0,q-8.47)^3+(-21.95865)*max(0,q-8.32)^3+7.81428*max(0,q-8.2)^3+2.89973*max(0,q-8.08)^3+(-0.87746)*max(0,q-7.6)^3+0.74143*max(0,q-7.12)^3
